  "description": "<div><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">The Role</span></strong></span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">The Process Analyst at PointClickCare plays a pivotal role in driving operational excellence by partnering with Senior leaders across Sales, Success, Professional Services and Support to analyze, design, and implement process improvements across the organization. This position is responsible for identifying gaps, recommending solutions, and coordinating cross-functional teams to deliver impactful business initiatives. By leveraging expertise in process analysis and project management, the Process Analyst ensures that new workflows and solutions enhance business performance and stakeholder satisfaction. Ultimately, this role contributes to&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">PointClickCare’s</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\"> mission of building innovative healthcare technology that improves the quality of life for seniors and their caregivers.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200}\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"2\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">What You’ll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner with senior leaders and cross-functional stakeholders to analyze existing systems and operational procedures, identifying opportunities to improve business performance through process redesign, AI, and automation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Lead structured discovery conversations, including interviews, workshops, and stakeholder walkthroughs, to understand current-state processes and future-state goals.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct gap and impact analyses to identify areas of risk and recommend solutions aligned with business needs and best practices.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collect and document business requirements for process improvement initiatives, and create and maintain clear, structured process maps.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Coordinate cross-functional project teams to deliver on established business goals, facilitating and participating in User Acceptance Testing and stakeholder alignment throughout implementation.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Act as a trusted process subject matter expert, guiding strategic conversations and decision-making on high-visibility initiatives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Serve as a valuable contributor to the broader continuous improvement methodology, helping shape how the team approaches continuous improvement work and raising the bar for the practice over time.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p aria-level=\"2\" role=\"heading\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Qualifications &amp; Skills</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven experience leading process analysis and improvement initiatives in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong facilitation and communication skills, with a demonstrated ability to build relationships with senior and executive leadership.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience designing and documenting process maps, workflows, and business requirements.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong organizational, project management, and problem-solving skills.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Stay current on process improvement trends, methodologies, and best practices, and bring that thinking proactively into ongoing initiatives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience leveraging AI to streamline business processes; MS CoPilot, Miro, Claude is a plus</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\" role=\"listitem\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience with Salesforce, Gainsight, Service Cloud, and Kantata.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul role=\"list\" style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li aria-setsize=\"-1\" data-leveltext=\"●\" data-font=\"\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803