  "descriptionBody": "<div><span xml:lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">The Role</span></strong></span></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span xml:lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">The Process Analyst at PointClickCare plays a pivotal role in driving operational excellence by partnering with Senior leaders across Sales, Success, Professional Services and Support to analyze, design, and implement process improvements across the organization. This position is responsible for identifying gaps, recommending solutions, and coordinating cross-functional teams to deliver impactful business initiatives. By leveraging expertise in process analysis and project management, the Process Analyst ensures that new workflows and solutions enhance business performance and stakeholder satisfaction. Ultimately, this role contributes to&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">PointClickCare&rsquo;s</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\"> mission of building innovative healthcare technology that improves the quality of life for seniors and their caregivers.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559738&quot;:200}\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"2\"><strong><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">What You&rsquo;ll Do</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:320,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" role=\"list\">\n<li role=\"listitem\" data-aria-level=\"1\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;●&quot;,&quot